  "id": "the-night-visitor",
  "title": "The Night Visitor",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "The Night Visitor Podcast is a cinematic horror anthology, blending psychological terror, immersive sound design, and character-driven storytelling. Each story unfolds across three weekly episodes, followed by a behind-the-scenes discussion hosted by co-creators Blu Topalli and Peter Stass. Together, they explore their collaborative process, the role of sound in creating immersive entertainment, and the real-world inspirations behind their horror narratives. Through its haunting stories and reflective commentary, The Night Visitor examines fear, morality, and social themes through the lens of horror. The result is a thought-provoking audio drama experience reminiscent of The Witch, The Terror, Sinners, and The Twilight Zone.",
